{
  "$schema": "../../schema/app.schema.json",
  "id": "h3-studio-director-flash",
  "name": "Flash H3 Studio Director",
  "section": "video",
  "pack": "video-h3-flash",
  "status": "ready",
  "summary": "A HyperFlow H3 Flash director: Material Planner segments, ordered references, synchronized sound, euler + Flash sigmas, 4/6/8 steps, video VAE picker.",
  "higgsfield_feature": "AI Director",
  "source": {
    "template": "RiverField_Director_studio.json (HyperFlow Flash variant)",
    "comfyui": "0.45.0",
    "notes": "Built from the Pika Studio Director graph (RiverFieldH3Planner + MiniMaxH3TimelinePlanner + MiniMaxH3FiniteSegmentVideoSampler) with the HyperFlow H3 Flash INT8 stack: HyperFlowINT8Loader (ref2va/fl2va, legacy patcher), HyperFlowSigmas at 4/6/8 steps (default 8), KSamplerSelect euler, p-H3 image int8 encoder by default, selectable video VAE (Lynnreal light int8 by default), audio VAE, SLA 0.80, multiple 32. The Pika LoRA, lcm sampler and ManualSigmas are removed; the Flash model carries its own HyperFlow schedule. The Flash single-clip apps (h3-video-flash, h3-r2v-flash, h3-i2v-flash, h3-flf2v-flash) are the measured baseline; this director combination has been rendered at the Production recipe below. Start with one 7.3 s segment."
  },
